            _t("Incident responder", "An incident responder helps contain a real problem, recover, and record what happened. The beginner skill is knowing who to tell and what not to switch off."),
            _t("Security engineer", "A security engineer builds and maintains controls: identity, logging, and safer defaults. The work is construction as much as investigation."),
            _t("Cloud security engineer", "A cloud security engineer applies those controls in services run by a cloud provider. The provider runs the building. You are still responsible for how you use the room."),
